WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:05.580
The year 1179 of the Allods Era.

2
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.300
Hightown, a city in Horizon.

3
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.580
Time flows like a dark river,

4
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.280
and the beginning of history lies hidden in its depths.

5
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.940
None of us was ready for the coming of the darkness

6
00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:22.260
that engulfed the allods one after another.

7
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.460
For many long years, our home was the Ark,

8
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:30.040
which set out on a journey through the endless Astral.

9
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:37.020
A century and a half later, here in Horizon, we found our new home.

10
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:44.060
Together, overcoming every hardship, we now live as one, our old enmity forgotten.

11
00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:51.250
Having built our city, we did everything we could to revive at least part of our former glory.

12
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.830
But these lands can hardly be called peaceful.

13
00:00:54.830 --> 00:01:02.710
We are surrounded by gloomy forests, full of vicious creatures, alien and dangerous.

14
00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:06.250
And yet we are ready to fight for our survival.

15
00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:12.040
Not all of us shared the responsibility for a difficult choice.

16
00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:18.880
Now these renegades have become yet another threat hanging over peaceful Hightown.

17
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:23.540
And once again, we must make hard decisions.

18
00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:30.180
And only time will tell whether we can stand firm before the enemy.
